            "The record should include a risk register with causes, possible consequences, early indicators, mitigation, and the office responsible for monitoring. It distinguishes risks created by the agreement from risks that exist regardless of signature. If a risk depends on an assumption, the assumption should be stated so a later government can revisit it rather than treating a forecast as fact.",
